+``wait_exponential_jitter`` takes a ``multiplier`` (default 1), the same argument
+``wait_exponential`` uses. Its older ``initial`` argument is deprecated.
+
+.. testcode::
+
+    @retry(wait=wait_exponential_jitter(multiplier=1, max=60))
+    def exponential_jitter_multiplier():
+        raise Exception
+
 When multiple processes are in contention for a shared resource, exponentially
 increasing jitter helps minimise collisions.
 
